# Resend branded email (required for booking / quote emails)
# Create an API key at https://resend.com/api-keys — never commit the real value.
# Set on Cloudflare Worker (production) AND locally for `next dev` / Vercel if used:
RESEND_API_KEY=
BOOKING_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=
BOOKING_FROM_EMAIL=bookings@myairporttaxini.co.uk
# BOOKING_TO_EMAIL is accepted as an alias for BOOKING_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL

# Domain verification steps (you must complete these in Resend — do not invent DNS values):
# See docs/RESEND_SETUP.md

# Add as GitHub Actions secrets (Settings → Secrets → Actions):
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_google_api_key
# BOOKINGS_API_URL=https://reimagined-octo-meme.cgr28.workers.dev/bookings
# Quote tool alerts POST to the same worker at /quote-leads (derived from BOOKINGS_API_URL).
# (Optional GitHub Actions secret — deploy-pages.yml uses this URL by default if unset)
#
# Cloudflare Worker deploy (GitHub Actions → Deploy Cloudflare Worker workflow):
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=...   (Cloudflare dashboard → My Profile → API Tokens → Edit Cloudflare Workers)
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=36c5c88df4c1f0259413d555f2679f3c
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...      (synced to the Worker by deploy-worker.yml)
# BOOKING_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=bookings@myairporttaxini.co.uk
# BOOKING_FROM_EMAIL=bookings@myairporttaxini.co.uk
#
# Recommended for numbered UK door addresses when typing a street name:
# GETADDRESS_DOMAIN_TOKEN=dtoken_...   (create at https://getaddress.io — restrict to your domain)
# Or set GETADDRESS_API_KEY on the Cloudflare Worker (preferred — used via /addresses API)
#
# In Google Cloud, restrict the key to HTTP referrers:
#   https://www.myairporttaxini.co.uk/*
#   https://myairporttaxini.co.uk/*
#
# Enable in Google Cloud (APIs & Services → Library):
#   - Places API (New)
# The route map uses OpenStreetMap and does not need Maps Embed API.

# One-shot worker setup (creates KV, sets secrets, deploys):
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=... GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=... RESEND_API_KEY=... node scripts/setup-worker.mjs
#
# Cloudflare Worker secrets (also set by setup-worker.mjs):
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_google_api_key
# GETADDRESS_API_KEY=your_getaddress_key   (server API key — not the domain token)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...   (primary branded email via Resend)
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=...   (optional legacy fallback only — not required once Resend is live)
#   IMPORTANT: add these to GitHub Actions secrets. deploy-worker.yml syncs them to Cloudflare:
#   GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY (or GOOGLE_API_KEY / GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY), GETADDRESS_API_KEY,
#   RESEND_API_KEY, BOOKING_FROM_EMAIL, BOOKING_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL.
#   Without GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY on the worker, /addresses returns [].
#   After adding secrets, push to main or run Deploy Cloudflare Worker.
#
# Booking references (MATNI-1001+) use KV — setup-worker.mjs creates BOOKING_COUNTER automatically.
#
# Email delivery: Resend (primary) → optional Cloudflare Email / MailChannels / Web3Forms fallbacks.
# FormSubmit has been removed. The browser never posts booking data to third-party form endpoints.
#
# Paid bookings (when SumUp is re-enabled): after payment, the worker verifies payment and emails:
# - Customer: booking confirmation + payment receipt
# - Owner (BOOKING_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL): full paid booking details
#
# SumUp — secure card payment when customers see a quote (Hosted Checkout):
# 1. Create an API key at https://developer.sumup.com/
# 2. Find your merchant code in the SumUp dashboard (Profile → Merchant account)
# SUMUP_API_KEY=sup_sk_...
# SUMUP_MERCHANT_CODE=YOUR_MERCHANT_CODE
#
# Google Ads (optional overrides — defaults for tag + Request quote live in src/lib/google-ads.ts):
# Sitewide Google tag + Consent Mode. request_quote fires after successful quote submit (#quoteResult).
# booking_complete Ads send_to stays OFF until you create that conversion in Google Ads and set:
# GOOGLE_ADS_BOOKING_CONVERSION_LABEL=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# Optional overrides (otherwise code defaults AW-18303631278 / _hcXCPSz7cscEK7_7JdE are used):
# GOOGLE_ADS_ID=AW-18303631278
# GOOGLE_ADS_QUOTE_CONVERSION_LABEL=_hcXCPSz7cscEK7_7JdE
# /booking-confirmed/ still works as a destination URL conversion without a booking label.
#
# Google Calendar booking log (Worker secrets — also add to GitHub Actions secrets):
# GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID=colinrice876@gmail.com
# GOOGLE_CALENDAR_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON={"type":"service_account",...}
# Share colinrice876@gmail.com with the service account email as "Make changes to events".
# Verify: https://reimagined-octo-meme.cgr28.workers.dev/calendar-status
# Setup script: CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=... GOOGLE_CALENDAR_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE=./key.json node scripts/setup-google-calendar.mjs
#
# Live driver tracking (Worker KV + secret):
# TRACKING_STORE KV namespace is created by setup-worker.mjs
# DRIVER_ACCESS_KEY=your_secret_key   (driver dashboard at /driver/)
# Customers receive a /track/?id=... link in their invoice (active ~2h before pickup).
